{"_id":"68a736278ec3d8323af1a741","nodeId":"7SGYNo3oHlgm_1cwhWfw7","roadmapSlug":"mongodb","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:19.293Z","description":"# Collection Methods\n\nCollection methods in MongoDB provide comprehensive operations for data manipulation including CRUD operations (find, insert, update, delete), index management, and administrative functions. Key methods include `createIndex()`, `drop()`, `count()`, `distinct()`, and `bulkWrite()` for batch operations. These methods offer flexible options for data processing, schema validation, and collection maintenance.","resources":[{"type":"course","title":"CRUD Operations Skill Badge","url":"https://learn.mongodb.com/courses/crud-operations-in-mongodb","_id":"6a7588c9b0650226a5eb4d86"},{"type":"official","title":"Collection Methods","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/js-collection/","_id":"6a7588c9b0650226a5eb4d87"},{"type":"official","title":"createIndex","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.createindex/","_id":"6a7588c9b0650226a5eb4d88"},{"type":"official","title":"count","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.count/","_id":"6a7588c9b0650226a5eb4d89"},{"type":"official","title":"distinct","url":"https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/method/db.collection.distinct/","_id":"6a7588c9b0650226a5eb4d8a"},{"type":"article","title":"A Comprehensive Guide to MongoDB Methods","url":"https://medium.com/@coderwithtools/a-comprehensive-guide-to-mongodb-methods-syntax-and-examples-feee0ac07599","_id":"6a7588c9b0650226a5eb4d8b"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-07T07:27:05.415Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/mongodb/content/7SGYNo3oHlgm_1cwhWfw7.md"}